          </h2>

          <p>
            Here are the five bottles we ranked, with figures taken from the label or the Amazon listing at the time of writing. Nutrition varies slightly by flavor, and formulas change, so check the panel on the exact flavor you buy. Cost per 25 g of protein is calculated from the Amazon price when we checked in November 2026; prices move, and Subscribe and Save usually takes 5 to 15 percent off.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-left">
                <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Bottle</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Protein</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Calories</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Sweetener</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Cost per 25 g</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Protein2o 20g</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">20 g / 16.9 oz</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 90</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Varies by flavor</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 3.15 dollars</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Isopure Clear Protein Water</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">15 g / 20 oz</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 60</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Stevia (flavored)</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 4.90 dollars</td>
                  </tr>
